{"id":"venga","lemma":"venga","pos":"intj","rank":266,"glosses":["A cheer or expression of support, encouragement, etc.; come on, attaboy","An expression of amazement or surprise; wow, whoa"],"ipa":"/ˈbenɡa/","examples":[{"text":"Quizá ella venga mañana.","en":"Perhaps she will come tomorrow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645269","words":[{"g":"perhaps, maybe"},{"g":"she"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Venga, ven aquí.","en":"Just come up here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443443","words":[null,{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Venga él o no, yo iré.","en":"Whether he comes or not, I'll go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1189093","words":[null,{"g":"he"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"}]},{"text":"Hagámoslo cuando él venga.","en":"Let's do it when he comes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524435","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"he"},null]},{"text":"Dale esta carta cuando venga.","en":"Give her this letter when she comes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/635496","words":[{"g":"OK, okey dokey, right"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"letter"},{"g":"when"},null]}]}